Here is a complete, self-contained, and ready-to-run app. It includes patient management, a clean interface for clinical notes (including a ready-to-use **SOAP format** template tailored for physiotherapy), and local storage so your data stays right in your browser.

### How to use it:
1. Save the code below into a file named **`index.html`**.
2. Double-click the file to open it in any web browser (Chrome, Safari, Edge, Firefox).
3. (Optional) Bookmark it for daily use.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>PhysioNotes - Clinical Notes Manager</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0284c7;
      --primary-hover: #0369a1;
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --text-main: #1e293b;
      --text-muted: #64748b;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

    header { background: var(--panel); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1rem 1.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    header h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary); }

    .app-container { display: flex; flex: 1; overflow: hidden; }

    /* Sidebar (Patient List) */
    .sidebar { width: 320px; background: var(--panel); border-right: 1px solid var(--border); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .sidebar-header { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .patient-list { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; list-style: none; }
    .patient-item { padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.15s; }
    .patient-item:hover { background: #f1f5f9; }
    .patient-item.active { background: #e0f2fe; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); }
    .patient-item h4 { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .patient-item p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); }

    /* Main Content Area */
    .main-content { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow-y: auto; padding: 1.5rem; }
    .empty-state { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100%; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; }

    /* Patient Details Header */
    .patient-header { background: var(--panel); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .patient-header-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

    /* Visit Notes List */
    .notes-section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .note-card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem; }
    .note-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .note-date { font-weight: 600; color: var(--primary); }
    .note-body { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #334155; }

    /* UI Inputs & Buttons */
    input, textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.4rem; }
    input:focus, textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--primary); }
    button { background: var(--primary); color: white; border: none; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    button:hover { background: var(--primary-hover); }
    button.secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    button.secondary:hover { background: #f8fafc; color: var(--text-main); }
    button.danger { background: #ef4444; }
    button.danger:hover { background: #dc2626; }

    /* Modal Styling */
    .modal-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 10; }
    .modal { background: white; border-radius: 8px; width: 500px; max-width: 90%; padding: 1.5rem; }
    .modal-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .modal-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>PhysioNotes</h1>
  </header>

  <div class="app-container">
    <!-- Left Sidebar: Patient List -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-header">
        <button style="width: 100%;" onclick="openModal('patientModal')">+ Add New Patient</button>
      </div>
      <ul class="patient-list" id="patientList"></ul>
    </aside>

    <!-- Right Pane: Active Patient & Notes -->
    <main class="main-content" id="mainContent">
      <div class="empty-state">Select a patient from the left or create a new one.</div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: Add Patient -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="patientModal">
    <div class="modal">
      <div class="modal-header"><h3>Add New Patient</h3></div>
      <form id="newPatientForm">
        <label>Full Name
          <input type="text" id="pName" required placeholder="e.g., Jane Doe">
        </label>
        <label style="margin-top: 0.8rem; display:block;">Primary Condition / Goal
          <input type="text" id="pCondition" required placeholder="e.g., Post-ACL reconstruction, Low back pain">
        </label>
        <div class="modal-actions">
          <button type="button" class="secondary" onclick="closeModal('patientModal')">Cancel</button>
          <button type="submit">Create Patient</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal: Add Note -->
  <div class="modal-overlay" id="noteModal">
    <div class="modal" style="width: 650px;">
      <div class="modal-header"><h3>Add Visit Note</h3></div>
      <form id="newNoteForm">
        <label>Visit Date
          <input type="date" id="visitDate" required>
        </label>
        <label style="margin-top: 0.8rem; display:block;">Clinical Notes (SOAP Format recommended)
          <textarea id="noteContent" rows="10" required></textarea>
        </label>
        <div class="modal-actions">
          <button type="button" class="secondary" onclick="closeModal('noteModal')">Cancel</button>
          <button type="submit">Save Visit Note</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // State initialization from browser LocalStorage
    let patients = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('physio_patients')) || [];
    let activePatientId = null;

    // Physio SOAP template helper
    const soapTemplate = `S (Subjective): \n- Pain Level (0-10): \n- Patient feedback/updates: \n\nO (Objective): \n- ROM / Movement tests: \n- Strength / Palpation: \n\nA (Assessment): \n- Progress vs last visit: \n\nP (Plan): \n- Interventions today (e.g. manual, dry needling): \n- Home exercises prescribed: `;

    function saveState() {
      localStorage.setItem('physio_patients', JSON.stringify(patients));
      renderPatientList();
    }

    function renderPatientList() {
      const list = document.getElementById('patientList');
      list.innerHTML = '';

      patients.forEach(patient => {
        const li = document.createElement('li');
        li.className = `patient-item ${patient.id === activePatientId ? 'active' : ''}`;
        li.onclick = () => selectPatient(patient.id);
        li.innerHTML = `
          <h4>${patient.name}</h4>
          <p>${patient.condition}</p>
        `;
        list.appendChild(li);
      });
    }

    function selectPatient(id) {
      activePatientId = id;
      renderPatientList();
      renderMainContent();
    }

    function renderMainContent() {
      const main = document.getElementById('mainContent');
      const patient = patients.find(p => p.id === activePatientId);

      if (!patient) {
        main.innerHTML = `<div class="empty-state">Select a patient or create a new one.</div>`;
        return;
      }

      // Sort notes: newest first
      const sortedNotes = [...patient.notes].sort((a, b) => new Date(b.date) - new Date(a.date));

      main.innerHTML = `
        <div class="patient-header">
          <div class="patient-header-top">
            <h2>${patient.name}</h2>
            <div>
              <button onclick="openNoteModal()">+ Add Visit Note</button>
              <button class="danger" style="margin-left: 0.5rem;" onclick="deletePatient('${patient.id}')">Delete Patient</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p><strong>Primary Condition:</strong> ${patient.condition}</p>
        </div>

        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Visits & Clinical Records (${patient.notes.length})</h3>

        <div class="notes-section">
          ${sortedNotes.length === 0 ? '<p style="color: var(--text-muted);">No notes recorded yet for this patient.</p>' : ''}
          ${sortedNotes.map(note => `
            <div class="note-card">
              <div class="note-meta">
                <span class="note-date">Visit Date: ${note.date}</span>
                <button class="secondary" style="padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem;" onclick="deleteNote('${note.id}')">Remove</button>
              </div>
              <div class="note-body">${note.text}</div>
            </div>
          `).join('')}
        </div>
      `;
    }

    // Modal controls
    function openModal(id) { document.getElementById(id).style.display = 'flex'; }
    function closeModal(id) { document.getElementById(id).style.display = 'none'; }

    function openNoteModal() {
      document.getElementById('visitDate').valueAsDate = new Date();
      document.getElementById('noteContent').value = soapTemplate;
      openModal('noteModal');
    }

    // Handlers
    document.getElementById('newPatientForm').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const newPatient = {
        id: Date.now().toString(),
        name: document.getElementById('pName').value.trim(),
        condition: document.getElementById('pCondition').value.trim(),
        notes: []
      };
      patients.push(newPatient);
      saveState();
      selectPatient(newPatient.id);
      closeModal('patientModal');
      e.target.reset();
    });

    document.getElementById('newNoteForm').addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const patient = patients.find(p => p.id === activePatientId);
      if (!patient) return;

      const newNote = {
        id: Date.now().toString(),
        date: document.getElementById('visitDate').value,
        text: document.getElementById('noteContent').value
      };

      patient.notes.push(newNote);
      saveState();
      renderMainContent();
      closeModal('noteModal');
    });

    function deletePatient(id) {
      if (confirm('Are you sure you want to delete this patient and all their notes?')) {
        patients = patients.filter(p => p.id !== id);
        activePatientId = null;
        saveState();
        renderMainContent();
      }
    }

    function deleteNote(noteId) {
      if (confirm('Delete this note?')) {
        const patient = patients.find(p => p.id === activePatientId);
        if (patient) {
          patient.notes = patient.notes.filter(n => n.id !== noteId);
          saveState();
          renderMainContent();
        }
      }
    }

    // Initial render
    renderPatientList();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

### Features included:
* **Patient Management:** Create patient profiles and assign conditions (e.g., *Post-op ACL, Rotator cuff tendinitis*).
* **SOAP Templates:** When creating a new visit note, it pre-populates a clinical **SOAP** (Subjective, Objective, Assessment, Plan) template specifically tuned for physiotherapy.
* **Persistent Data:** Uses the browser's built-in `localStorage`. If you refresh or close the page, the data stays there.
* **Privacy:** All data is kept strictly inside your local computer's browser storage (no outside servers involved).

